# Sokka, Bold Boomeranger ({U}{R}, 1/1): "When Sokka enters, discard up to two cards, then draw that many cards." Bot1 casts it with Mox
# Ruby and Mox Sapphire, leaving Bolt, Bolt, Plains, Plains in hand, and discards both Bolts: it then draws two (the Islands on top:
# the discards come first, so the drawn cards can't be among them). The Moxes were cast before Sokka was on the battlefield, so no
# counter: it is still 1/1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Sokka, Bold Boomeranger
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Plains
Plains
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sokka, Bold Boomeranger.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt; Lightning Bolt)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Plains; Plains
Bot1.Library.Count = 11
Bot1.Battlefield.Sokka, Bold Boomeranger.Power = 1
